title: R1_1
---
<<if change_person("Hilaire", "Neutral")>>
<<endif>>
<<wait_until_entered>>
<<trigger_talk>>
Hilaire: Hello assistant. Do you happen to know why we are missing 300 gold from our vault?
<<set_mood "Neutral">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Hilaire: Gwendolen was supposed to receive 300 gold as an award. Do you know anything about this?
<<end_of_response>>
===

title: R1_2
---
<<if change_person("Gwen", "Neutral")>>//you need if for it to work :(
<<endif>>
<<wait_until_entered>>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: Assistant! I need your help, someone knows a dark secret of mine and I am required to send them gold
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: Can you help me set up this arrangement ASAP? I will send over their pidegeon number so you can work out the details.
<<set_mood "Happy">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: Thanks for letting me know this info, you’re a lifesaver!!!
<<end_of_response>>
===

title: R1_3
---
<<if change_person("Gwen", "Happy")>>//you need if for it to work :(
<<endif>>
<<wait_until_entered>>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: Hello assistant. Thank the magical wonders that you brought me Meredith’s scroll!
<<set_mood "Neutral">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: If I would have ignored her scrolls three times in a row, the skies would have turned purple and the thunder would be the least of our worries.
<<end_of_response>>
===

title: R1_4
---
<<if change_person("Cressida", "Neutral")>>//you need if for it to work :(
<<endif>>
<<wait_until_entered>>
<<trigger_talk>>
Cressida: Dear assistant, Yesterday there was an incident involving a pidgeon.
<<trigger_talk>>
Cressida: It had, luckily, been lost on the way to something called “Treasury Lodge” and had found its way into our treasury instead.
<<set_mood "Happy">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Cressida: Reviewing yesterday’s communications, I am pleased to see that you instead caught the scam and reported it! As I care deeply for security, you have my thanks.
<<end_of_response>>
===

title: R1_5
---
<<if change_person("Gwen", "Neutral")>>//you need if for it to work :(
<<endif>>
<<wait_until_entered>>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: Goodmorning assistant! Thank you for your hard work.
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: My friend over at Oberon Reanimation got a concerning scroll the other day, blackmailing her about her dark secrets.
<<set_mood "Happy">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: Luckily, all her dark secrets are already out in the open, so it must be a scam, haha!
<<set_mood "Neutral">>
<<trigger_talk>> 
Gwendolen: If I had gotten such a scroll I would have sent them all my gold… Keep your eyes peeled!
<<end_of_response>>
===

title: R1_6
---
<<if change_person("Gwen", "Neutral")>>//you need if for it to work :(
<<endif>>
<<wait_until_entered>>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: Hello assistant. Meredith from Mystical Harmonisation bursted into my office yesterday during lunch.
<<set_mood "Angry">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: She claimed that I’ve been ignoring her for three days now. The thing is that I only remember ignoring her for two of those days.
<<set_mood "Neutral">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: Please be more thorough when sorting through my scrolls in the future.
<<end_of_response>>
===

