<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: I must have missed some words in the attunement spell or something, I think my tome is now corrupt!
<<set_mood "Neutral">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: Please go ask Tilly to come to me as soon as she has time!
<<end_of_response>>
